@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+### 🏎 Performance
+
+- `GitRepo.get_submodules_()`, and thus `datalad subdatasets` given paths,
+  matches subdataset paths against the path constraints about 3-4x faster,
+  which helps in datasets with many subdatasets.
+  ([PR #7986](https://github.com/datalad/datalad/pull/7986))
+  (by [@dexhunter](https://github.com/dexhunter))
